A||N||5||Bigfieroman||Feasibility/reasonability of Removing Swaybar?||||1||
Z||000000||Bigfieroman||12-02-2000||02:11 PM||||I was thinkingof getting a used front sway bar and converting it to rear, and then I had a thought:  Could I not just remove the front swaybar to get the same effect?  Thoughts?  Thanks.<P>------------------<BR>I'm sorry officer, but it isn't my fault you can't catch me on the turns.  Want to go for a ride?||||reg||1
Z||000001||theogre||12-02-2000||02:16 PM||||No, forget that idea right now...... eliminating the swaybar will not help handling.||||reg||1
